# anthropic_federation_rules (Data Source)

Lists Workload Identity Federation (WIF) rules in the organization (beta). All pages are fetched automatically.
Optionally filter by issuer with `issuer_id`. Archived rules are excluded unless `include_archived` is `true`.

> **API**: `GET /v1/organizations/federation_rules` (beta).
> **Auth**: org:admin OAuth bearer token (`auth_token` / `ANTHROPIC_AUTH_TOKEN`). Admin API keys are not accepted on this endpoint.
> **Cost**: Free.

